      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹6.15. Revenue: ₹436.2m (up 11% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹63.9m (flat on 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 15% (down from 16% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses.",
