      "date": "2025-11-11T11:29:55.000Z",
      "title": "Second quarter 2026 earnings released",
      "body": "Second quarter 2026 results: Revenue: ₹401.0m (up 6.4% from 2Q 2025). Net income: ₹53.8m (down 2.2% from 2Q 2025). Profit margin: 13% (down from 15% in 2Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 3% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 12% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
